ok registered
# position and range (UIF-711)
ok clamped to Max
ok OnChange for code
ok equal position: no OnChange
ok PageSize 10: Max - 9
ok clamping by the page fires OnChange
ok range change keeps the position
ok range change without a position change: no OnChange
ok Min above the position
ok clamping by Min fires OnChange
ok SetParams
ok SetParams: Max < Min
ok rejected: unchanged
ok Min above Max
ok LargeChange at least 1
ok LargeChange at most 32767
# window
ok system class SCROLLBAR
ok SBS_HORZ
ok range, page and position pushed
ok position with a handle
ok Kind recreates
ok SBS_VERT
ok state kept
ok at run time Kind does not swap the bounds
# user (UIF-710)
ok SB_LINEDOWN: + SmallChange
ok SB_LINEUP: - SmallChange
ok SB_PAGEDOWN: + LargeChange
ok SB_PAGEUP: - LargeChange
ok SB_BOTTOM: Max, clamped by the page
ok the native position follows
ok at the end: clamped, no OnChange
ok SB_TOP: Min
ok SB_ENDSCROLL: the position stays
ok OnScroll may alter the position, clamped again
ok vertical: CN_VSCROLL
